cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software in your research, please cite it as below."
title: "DSCNS: Dynamic Self-Modifying Cognitive Network System"
abstract: >-
  A research prototype exploring dynamic modular neural systems with
  continual learning, candidate knowledge validation, selective
  internalization, memory, meta-cognition, and structural evolution.
  Includes a learned structural self-modification policy (Phase 4).
  Early research prototype (v0.2.0); experimental results include mixed
  and negative findings and should be interpreted conservatively.
